{"id": "memory-action-add-preserved", "category": "memory_conflict", "description": "ADD 语义原样保留，由后端判断同身份记忆是否已存在", "engine": "recorded", "request": {"userMessage": "我理解 TLB 就是页表项的缓存。"}, "llmResponse": {"memoryCandidates": [{"scopeType": "GLOBAL", "memoryType": "PREFERENCE", "memoryKey": "pref/hardware-first", "content": "用户喜欢先看硬件执行路径", "action": "ADD"}]}, "expect": {"memory.count": 1, "memory.actions": ["ADD"], "memory.keys": ["pref/hardware-first"]}}
{"id": "memory-action-update-preserved", "category": "memory_conflict", "description": "UPDATE 语义原样保留；后端只会更新仍是 CANDIDATE 的那条", "engine": "recorded", "request": {"userMessage": "我理解 TLB 就是页表项的缓存。"}, "llmResponse": {"memoryCandidates": [{"scopeType": "GLOBAL", "memoryType": "PREFERENCE", "memoryKey": "pref/hardware-first", "content": "用户更强调从 MMU 视角理解", "action": "UPDATE"}]}, "expect": {"memory.count": 1, "memory.actions": ["UPDATE"]}}
{"id": "memory-action-ignore-preserved", "category": "memory_conflict", "description": "IGNORE 也保留在结果里 —— 让后端日志能看出「模型想过但不写」，而不是凭空消失", "engine": "recorded", "request": {"userMessage": "我理解 TLB 就是页表项的缓存。"}, "llmResponse": {"memoryCandidates": [{"scopeType": "GLOBAL", "content": "用户好像有点累", "action": "IGNORE"}]}, "expect": {"memory.count": 1, "memory.actions": ["IGNORE"]}}
{"id": "memory-conflict-blank-content-dropped", "category": "memory_conflict", "description": "空白内容不是一条可写的记忆，不能进入后端 Reconcile", "engine": "recorded", "request": {"userMessage": "我理解 TLB 就是页表项的缓存。"}, "llmResponse": {"memoryCandidates": [{"scopeType": "GLOBAL", "content": "   ", "action": "ADD"}, {"scopeType": "GLOBAL", "content": "有效内容", "action": "ADD"}]}, "expect": {"memory.count": 1, "memory.contents": ["有效内容"]}}
{"id": "memory-conflict-importance-clamped", "category": "memory_conflict", "description": "importance 越界被裁剪到 [0,1]，避免影响后端排序与阈值判断", "engine": "recorded", "request": {"userMessage": "我理解 TLB 就是页表项的缓存。"}, "llmResponse": {"memoryCandidates": [{"scopeType": "GLOBAL", "content": "很重要的一条", "importance": 1.9}, {"scopeType": "GLOBAL", "content": "不重要的一条", "importance": -0.5}]}, "expect": {"memory.count": 2, "memory.importance": [1.0, 0.0]}}
